546
00:31:29,480 --> 00:31:31,240
O meu Restaurante
Yixiang quer meia carcaça.

547
00:31:31,310 --> 00:31:32,310
Obrigado, Sr. Li.

548
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:33,800
